<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Edna &amp; Maud's — For the stuff nobody talks about</title>
<meta name="description" content="Edna & Maud's is a wellness brand for the stuff nobody talks about. Coming soon.">

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond';
    src: url('CormorantGaramond.ttf') format('truetype');
    font-weight: 300 800;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond';
    src: url('CormorantGaramond-Italic.ttf') format('truetype');
    font-weight: 300 800;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'DM Sans';
    src: url('DMSans.ttf') format('truetype');
    font-weight: 300 800;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  :root{
    --ink: #2D3F54;
    --slate: #4A6F8A;
    --slate-soft: #7C97AC;
    --sand: #C4A882;
    --sand-light: #E8DCC6;
    --rose: #D98A80;
    --paper: #FAF6EF;
    --paper-warm: #F3ECDF;
    --charcoal: #322E29;
    --max: 1180px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--charcoal);
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}

  a{color:inherit;}

  .wrap{max-width:var(--max); margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;}

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.22em;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  /* reduced motion */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation:none !important; transition:none !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  .nav{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:50;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:22px 32px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,20,30,0.38) 0%, rgba(15,20,30,0.0) 100%);
  }
  .nav-mark{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:22px;
    color:#fff;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  }
  .nav-cta{
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:#fff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    padding:9px 20px;
    border-radius:999px;
    text-decoration:none;
    backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    transition:background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{ background:#fff; color:var(--ink); text-shadow:none;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    background:linear-gradient(165deg, var(--ink) 0%, var(--slate) 55%, var(--slate-soft) 100%);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-inner{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    width:100%;
    padding:100px 32px 100px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .hero-dogs{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:flex-end;
    gap:6px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .hero-dogs img{
    height:180px;
    width:auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.28));
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(64px, 13vw, 120px);
    color:#fff;
    line-height:0.95;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.2em;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#fff;
    background:rgba(74,111,138,0.55);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
    padding:8px 20px;
    border-radius:999px;
    display:inline-block;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .hero .tagline{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:clamp(19px, 2.6vw, 27px);
    color:var(--sand-light);
    background:rgba(196,168,130,0.14);
    border:1px solid rgba(196,168,130,0.55);
    backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
    padding:8px 26px;
    border-radius:999px;
    display:inline-block;
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }

  .waitlist-form{
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
    padding:8px;
    border-radius:999px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    width:100%;
    max-width:460px;
  }
  .waitlist-form input[type="email"]{
    flex:1;
    border:none;
    background:transparent;
    padding:12px 18px;
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--charcoal);
    outline:none;
  }
  .waitlist-form button{
    border:none;
    background:var(--sand);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:14px;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    padding:12px 26px;
    border-radius:999px;
    cursor:pointer;
    white-space:nowrap;
    transition:background .2s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  .waitlist-form button:hover{ background:#d9c19c; transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .waitlist-form button:focus-visible, .waitlist-form input:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--rose); outline-offset:2px;
  }
  .waitlist-note{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:700;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    margin-top:14px;
    opacity:0.85;
    text-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .form-success{
    display:none;
    color:#fff;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:20px;
    margin-top:6px;
  }

  .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute; bottom:24px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    z-index:2; color:#fff; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.75;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .scroll-cue .line{width:1px; height:34px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); animation:pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
  @keyframes pulse{ 0%,100%{opacity:0.3;} 50%{opacity:0.9;} }

  /* ---------- MEET PHOTO ---------- */
  .meet-photo{
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:70px 0 20px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .meet-photo-img{
    width:100%;
    max-width:900px;
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(45,63,84,0.18);
    margin:0 auto;
    display:block;
  }
  .meet-photo-caption{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--slate);
    font-size:18px;
    margin-top:22px;
  }

  /* ---------- STORY ---------- */
  .story{
    padding:120px 0 100px;
    background:var(--paper);
  }
  .story-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .story-quote{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size:clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 42px);
    line-height:1.25;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .story-quote em{color:var(--slate); font-style:italic;}
  .story-body p{
    font-size:16.5px;
    line-height:1.75;
    color:var(--charcoal);
    margin:0 0 18px;
  }
  .story-signoff{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--slate);
    font-size:19px;
    margin-top:10px;
  }

  /* ---------- AISLES (signature element: hanging placard signage) ---------- */
  .aisles{
    background:var(--ink);
    padding:110px 0 130px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .aisles-head{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:70px;
  }
  .aisles-head .eyebrow{color:var(--sand);}
  .aisles-head h2{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px);
    margin-top:10px;
  }
  .aisle-row, .concern-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:36px;
  }
  .concern-grid{
    row-gap:56px;
  }
  .aisle-card, .concern-card{
    position:relative;
    padding-top:38px;
  }
  .aisle-sign{
    position:absolute;
    top:-18px; left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-2deg);
    background:var(--sand-light);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:7px 16px;
    border-radius:4px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .aisle-card:nth-child(2) .aisle-sign, .concern-card:nth-child(2) .aisle-sign,
  .concern-card:nth-child(5) .aisle-sign{ transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(1.5deg); }
  .aisle-card:nth-child(3) .aisle-sign, .concern-card:nth-child(3) .aisle-sign,
  .concern-card:nth-child(6) .aisle-sign{ transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-1deg); }
  .concern-card:nth-child(4) .aisle-sign{ transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(2deg); }

  .aisle-panel{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:44px 30px 34px;
    height:100%;
    text-align:center;
    transition:transform .25s ease, background .25s ease;
  }
  .aisle-panel:hover{ transform:translateY(-6px); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .aisle-panel h3{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:26px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .aisle-panel p{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.65;
    margin:0 0 18px;
  }
  .aisle-tag{
    display:inline-block;
    font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--sand);
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    padding-top:14px;
    margin-top:6px;
    width:100%;
  }

  /* ---------- EDITORIAL: ASK MAUD + EDNA'S BEST OF ---------- */
  .editorial{
    padding:110px 0;
    background:var(--paper);
  }
  .editorial-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:40px;
    align-items:stretch;
  }
  .ed-card{
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:44px 40px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
  }
  .ed-card h3{ font-size:34px; margin:6px 0 2px; }
  .ed-sub{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--slate);
    font-size:17px;
    margin:0 0 26px;
  }

  .ask-maud{
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid rgba(74,111,138,0.14);
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(45,63,84,0.08);
  }
  .letter{
    background:var(--paper-warm);
    border:1px solid rgba(196,168,130,0.4);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px 26px;
    margin-bottom:24px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .letter::before{
    content:"\201C";
    position:absolute; top:6px; left:16px;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size:64px;
    color:rgba(74,111,138,0.16);
    line-height:1;
  }
  .letter .q{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:19px;
    color:var(--charcoal);
    margin:0 0 14px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .letter .a{
    font-size:15.5px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0 0 10px;
  }
  .letter .sign{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--slate);
    font-size:16px;
    margin:0;
    text-align:right;
  }
  .ed-link{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--slate);
    text-decoration:none;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    margin-top:auto;
  }
  .ed-link:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }

  .edna-best{
    background:var(--ink);
  }
  .edna-best h3{ color:#fff; }
  .edna-best .ed-sub{ color:var(--sand-light); }
  .best-list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:0 0 20px;
    padding:0;
    flex:1;
  }
  .best-list li{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
    padding:16px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
  }
  .best-list li:first-child{ padding-top:0; }
  .best-name{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.4;
  }
  .best-link{
    color:var(--sand);
    font-size:13.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    text-decoration:none;
    white-space:nowrap;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .best-link:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }
  .ed-note{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    font-style:italic;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    margin-top:auto;
  }

  /* ---------- DELIVERY ---------- */
  .delivery{
    padding:110px 0;
    background:var(--paper-warm);
  }
  .delivery-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .delivery h2{ font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,46px); margin-bottom:20px;}
  .delivery p{ font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.75; color:var(--charcoal); margin:0 0 16px;}
  .delivery-card{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:38px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(45,63,84,0.10);
    border:1px solid rgba(74,111,138,0.12);
  }
  .delivery-card .eyebrow{margin-bottom:10px; display:block;}
  .delivery-card h3{ font-size:24px; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .delivery-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0;}
  .delivery-list li{
    display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;
    font-size:14.5px; color:var(--charcoal);
    padding:10px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(45,63,84,0.08);
  }
  .delivery-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .delivery-list .dot{
    width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--rose); margin-top:7px; flex-shrink:0;
  }

  /* ---------- WAITLIST BAND ---------- */
  .waitlist-band{
    background:var(--slate);
    padding:90px 0;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .waitlist-band h2{
    color:#fff;
    font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,50px);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .waitlist-band p{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    font-size:16px;
    margin:0 auto 34px;
    max-width:460px;
  }
  .waitlist-band .waitlist-form{
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .waitlist-band .waitlist-note{ color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    padding:50px 0 34px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  footer::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:url('IMG_4507.jpg');
    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center 30%;
    opacity:0.55;
  }
  footer .wrap{ position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .footer-top{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px;
    padding-bottom:28px;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .footer-mark{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:22px;
    color:#fff;
  }
  .footer-social{
    display:flex; gap:18px;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:0.05em;
  }
  .footer-social a{text-decoration:none; opacity:0.8; transition:opacity .2s;}
  .footer-social a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .footer-fine{
    font-size:11.5px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
    max-width:760px;
  }

  /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 880px){
    .story-grid, .delivery-grid, .editorial-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px;}
    .aisle-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:56px;}
    .concern-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px 24px; }
    .hero-dogs img{height:110px;}
    .waitlist-form{flex-direction:column; border-radius:22px; padding:14px;}
    .waitlist-form input[type="email"]{padding:10px 8px;}
    .waitlist-form button{width:100%; padding:13px;}
    .ed-card{padding:34px 26px;}
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px){
    .concern-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:44px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-mark">Edna &amp; Maud's</div>
  <a href="#waitlist" class="nav-cta">Join the list</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-dogs">
      <img src="edna.png" alt="Edna, illustrated with glasses" loading="eager">
      <img src="maud.png" alt="Maud, illustrated with glasses" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <h1>Edna &amp; Maud's</h1>
    <div class="tagline">We say the quiet part.<br>Out loud.</div>
    <p style="color:var(--sand-light); font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.02em; margin:-14px 0 30px; opacity:0.95;">
      Your one-stop shop for gummies, tools &amp; everyday relief — for the midlife stuff nobody talks about.
    </p>

    <form class="waitlist-form" id="waitlistForm" action="#" method="POST">
      <label for="email" class="visually-hidden" style="position:absolute; left:-9999px;">Email address</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required>
      <button type="submit">Join the list</button>
    </form>
    <div class="form-success" id="formSuccess">You're on the list. We'll be in touch. 💌</div>
    <div class="waitlist-note">Coming soon &nbsp;·&nbsp; No spam, just the launch &nbsp;·&nbsp; Unsubscribe anytime</div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-cue"><span>Scroll</span><span class="line"></span></div>
</section>

<!-- MEET EDNA & MAUD -->
<section class="meet-photo">
  <div class="wrap">
    <img src="IMG_4592.jpeg" alt="Edna and Maud sitting in beach chairs, dishing under a canopy at sunset" class="meet-photo-img">
    <p class="meet-photo-caption">Edna &amp; Maud, catching up &mdash; same as always.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STORY -->
<section class="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:16px;">Our Story</div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap story-grid">
    <div class="story-quote">
      One says it straight. <em>One says it proper.</em> Neither one holds back.
    </div>
    <div class="story-body">
      <p>Edna was a nurse — direct, unshockable, and just as happy to talk about your body as your blood pressure if the room was safe enough for it. Maud was a doctor's wife of the old-school kind — polished in public, perfectly proper... right up until the door closed. Then the tongue came out.</p>
      <p>Both of them spent their whole lives around medicine that had a habit of telling women "it's nothing" when it very much was not.</p>
      <p>Their granddaughter started this company because it never all lived in one spot. The gummies were over here, the good scalp brush was buried in some Reddit thread, and nobody was talking about the GLP-1 side effects out loud, let alone pointing you to what actually helps.</p>
      <div class="story-signoff">Edna and Maud never whispered. So neither do we.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AISLES -->
<section class="aisles" id="shop-by-concern">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="aisles-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Shop by concern</div>
      <h2>Whatever it is,<br>there's an aisle for it.</h2>
      <p style="max-width:560px; margin:22px auto 0; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.68); font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;">
        Gummies, tools, and everyday relief, all in one place — so you're not piecing together five different brands for five different things nobody warned you about.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="concern-grid">
      <div class="concern-card" id="hot-flashes-sleep">
        <div class="aisle-sign">Aisle One</div>
        <div class="aisle-panel">
          <h3>Hot Flashes &amp; Sleep</h3>
          <p>For the nights the thermostat becomes a personal enemy.</p>
          <span class="aisle-tag">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="concern-card" id="mood-energy">
        <div class="aisle-sign">Aisle Two</div>
